    "statement": "∀ {E : Type u_1} [inst : NormedAddCommGroup E] [inst_1 : InnerProductSpace ℝ E] [inst_2 : FiniteDimensional ℝ E]\n  [inst_3 : MeasurableSpace E] [BorelSpace E] {S : Type u_3} [inst_5 : MeasurableSpace S] {V : E → ℝ} {α β : NNReal},\n  ContDiff ℝ 2 V →\n    (∀ (x v : E), ↑α * ‖v‖ ^ 2 ≤ ((fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ V) x) v) v ∧ ((fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ V) x) v) v ≤ ↑β * ‖v‖ ^ 2) →\n      α ≤ β →\n        0 < ↑β →\n          0 < ↑(Module.finrank ℝ E) →\n            ∀ {b : S → ℝ} {u initial : S → E},\n              Measurable b →\n                (∀ (s : S), 0 < b s) →\n                  Measurable u →\n                    Measurable initial →\n                      ∀ (ell eps : ℝ),\n                        2 ≤ ell →\n                          0 < eps →\n                            eps ≤ 1 / 2 →\n                              (∀ (s : S),\n                                  64 * ↑β *\n                                      (√(↑(Module.finrank ℝ E) * (ell + Real.log (1 / eps))) +\n                                        (ell + Real.log (1 / eps))) ≤\n                                    b s) →\n                                have d := ↑(Module.finrank ℝ E);\n                                have F := fun s x => V x + b s / 2 * ‖x - u s‖ ^ 2;\n                                have T := fun s x => x - (↑β + b s)⁻¹ • gradient (F s) x;\n                                have Qn := fun n s => ‖gradient (F s) ((T s)^[n] (initial s))‖ ^ 2;\n                                have N := fun s => if h : ∃ n, Qn n s ≤ (fun s => d * b s) s then Nat.find h else 0;\n                                have xp := fun s => (T s)^[N s] (initial s);\n                                have A := fun s => (b s)⁻¹;\n                                have g := fun s => gradient V (xp s);\n                                have h := fun s => u s - A s • g s;\n                                have ν :=\n                                  (MeasureTheory.MeasureSpace.volume.restrict (Set.Ioc 0 1)).prod\n         