                 Real.log\n                                                                        (∫ (x : E),\n                                                                          ((π s).rnDeriv (R s) x).toReal ^ ell ∂R s) /\n                                                                      (ell - 1) ≤\n                                                                    eps ^ 2 ∧\n                                                                  Real.log\n                                                                          (∫ (x : E),\n                                                                            ((R s).rnDeriv (π s) x).toReal ^ ell ∂π s) /\n                                                                        (ell - 1) ≤\n                                                                      eps ^ 2 ∧\n                                                                    MeasureTheory.Measure.map (Φ s) (ρ s) = ρa s ∧\n                                                                      (∀ (ω : ℕ → E × ℕ × (ℕ → ℝ × E) × ℝ) (n : ℕ),\n                                                                          Φ s ω n ∈\n                                                                              {p |\n                                                                                p.2.2.2 ≤\n                                                                                  ∏ i,\n                                                                                    (1 + Wa s (p.1, p.2.2.1 ↑i)) /\n                                                                                      (2 * 1)} ↔\n                                                                            ω n ∈\n                                                                              {p |\n                                                                                p.2.2.2 ≤\n                                                                                  ∏ i,\n              