                     (Φ s ω (Nat.find h)).1\n                                                                              else u s) =ᵐ[ρ s]\n                                                                            fun omega =>\n                                                                            if h :\n                                                                                ∃ n,\n                                                                                  omega n ∈\n                                                                                    {p |\n                                                                                      p.2.2.2 ≤\n                                                                                        ∏ i,\n                                                                                          (1 + W s (p.1, p.2.2.1 ↑i)) /\n                                                                                            (2 * 1)} then\n                                                                              (omega (Nat.find h)).1\n                                                                            else 0",
